    "name": "VirusTotal API v3 - IoC Feeds IoC Feeds - File intelligence\u2026",
    "description": "Per-minute and hourly intelligence feed batches for files, URLs, domains, IP addresses, and sandbox analyses. Premium tier required.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: VirusTotal / Google Threat Intelligence",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
