                        "description": "> \ud83d\udea7 Special privileges required\n>\n> File feeds endpoints are only available to users with a File feeds license. For this particular endpoint, download file privilege is also required. Contact us for more information.\n\nEach JSON object contained in the file feed packages include a URL to this API endpoint to download the corresponding file. The link only works during the feed's lifetime, which is 7 days. Check /feeds/files/{time} for more information."
